@startuml
title GET /api/v1/pods/{pod_id}/stats/commanders
hide footbox
actor Client
participant "FastAPI / Pydantic" as API
participant "SQLAlchemy session" as DB
database PostgreSQL as PG
Client -> API: GET /api/v1/pods/{pod_id}/stats/commanders
API -> API: Validate path, query and body
note over API: Invalid input -> 422
API -> DB: get_db(): request transaction
ref over API, DB: Clerk identity and route permissions (auth.puml)
DB -> PG: Find pod; missing -> 404
DB -> PG: Join players, games and results scoped to pod
DB -> PG: Exclude null/blank main cards
DB -> PG: Group exact main_card/secondary_card; count appearances, wins, draws
DB -> PG: Order by main then secondary (null first); apply limit/offset
PG --> DB: Rows / mutation outcome
DB --> API: Route result
API -> API: win_rate = round(100 * wins / appearances, 2)
API -> API: Validate/serialize response
API -> DB: Finish successful request
DB -> PG: COMMIT
API --> Client: 200
@enduml
